### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/events/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Team Meeting",
  "date": "2026-02-12"
}

### List events (JSON)
GET http://localhost:3000/events/all

### Render events fragment (HTMX)
GET http://localhost:3000/events/fragment
HX-Request: true

### Render event select dropdown (HTMX)
GET http://localhost:3000/events/select
HX-Request: true

### Render event select dropdown with a selected event
GET http://localhost:3000/events/select?eventId=REPLACE_EVENT_ID
HX-Request: true

### Submit availability (replace with real event id)
POST http://localhost:3000/availability/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "REPLACE_EVENT_ID",
  "name": "Ava",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "10:00"
}

### List availability for a specific event
GET http://localhost:3000/availability/read?eventId=REPLACE_EVENT_ID

### Render availability fragment (HTMX)
GET http://localhost:3000/availability/fragment
HX-Request: true

### Delete availability (replace with real availability id)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/availability/delete/REPLACE_AVAILABILITY_ID

### List all availability (not implemented)
GET http://localhost:3000/availability/all

### Read availability by id (not implemented)
GET http://localhost:3000/availability/read/REPLACE_AVAILABILITY_ID

### Update availability (not implemented)
PUT http://localhost:3000/availability/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "REPLACE_EVENT_ID"
}
